# BlueBoat SITL parameters
# Base values are the ones documented in SITL_Models/Gazebo/docs/BlueBoat.md as the
# "minor modifications" that make the default skid-steer rover params workable.
CRUISE_SPEED      2.0
CRUISE_THROTTLE   50.0
FRAME_CLASS       2.0
WP_SPEED          2.0

# Realistic arming checks.
# NOTE: ArduPilot 4.8.0-dev has NO `ARMING_CHECK` parameter — setting it fails with
# "Unable to find parameter 'ARMING_CHECK'". It was replaced by ARMING_SKIPCHK, a
# bitmask of checks to *SKIP* (AP_Arming.cpp: AP_GROUPINFO("SKIPCHK", 13, ...,
# checks_to_skip, 0)). 0 = skip nothing = ALL pre-arm checks enabled, which is the
# default. Set explicitly here so the intent is visible and can't silently regress.
# (-1 would skip all non-mandatory checks — the opposite of what we want.)
ARMING_SKIPCHK    0
